!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.64, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID SB000084  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 313"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 233761, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  51 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  No
! remark cards, no TAIL card.  Located rows run contiguous from
! 233761.00 (line 1) to 234021.00 (line 51, SVA, a half word; next
! location 234021.40), then blank paper.  "*" after the LOCATION on
! lines 9, 29 and 45.
!   lines 1-3  null operations ", D LOCS", ", PROSA", ", 0" -- the tail
!              of a list begun on p.312 (not landed).
!   line 51    "SVA,6, $+0.32 -N - 512 + W(ALPHA) IN CF$8": the remark
!              begins at "-N"; the binary 234021.55 is $+0.32 alone.
! JOIN.  p.312 has no scratch neighbour; contiguity with it is NOT
! established here.  p.314 should open at 234021.40 with serial
! SB000127 (or SB000126 continued).  Independent witness of the
! assembly: b7decks p.269 (same body assembly) SYNs XNFOST at
! (8)234212.40 and CBUFF at (8)234214.0, which this page's SV line 45
! and SF line 4 print.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "X TO LK" (line 12, 16) and "X FRO LK" (lines 13, 18, 22): the
!     drum's open round glyph; written O (XTOLK / XFROLK, "to link" /
!     "from link").  No landed deck or C22-6728 spells either.
!   * "B, CREAC" (line 38): D with a worn stem; CREAD (C22-6728-1
!     prints CREAD).  "CW DC RD" (line 36): first glyph has the D stem
!     at 900 dpi, second is a real C -> CWDCRD.
!   * "CMOCOO" (line 31) = CM0000 (connective digits).
!   * "CNT BUF + 0.C1" (line 29) = CNTBUF+0.01.
!   * LINE 36'S LAST BYTE PRINTS "AC" AND IS A0.  At 900 dpi the glyph
!     after A is the same open round as the 0 of ".02" beside it; TI's
!     low nibble is I2 and no second-operand index is printed.  Same
!     case as landed p.197 line 11 (TI, "AC" = A0).
!   * octal / hex fields with an open round read 0 ("DC" = D0, "CO" =
!     00, "FC" / "FO" = F0, "2C" = 20, "C1" = 01).
!   * names spaced by the drum (C ALPHA, C DSK BF, X LIMIT, C BF MAP,
!     CHK PAR, A DSK RD, X N FOST, C DELTA, C SET J, C GAMMA, D LOCS)
!     written closed up.  CBFMAP, CHKPAR, CPRERD, XNFOST are C22-6728
!     spellings.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Values for symbols defined on pages not landed come from
! this page's binary (each comment says how much it fixes).
!
